@Catalogo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Listar libros
GET {{Catalogo.Api_HostAddress}}/libros
Accept: application/json

### Registrar libro
POST {{Catalogo.Api_HostAddress}}/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "abc-001",
  "titulo": "Domain-Driven Design"
}

### Desactivar libro
POST {{Catalogo.Api_HostAddress}}/libros/1/desactivar
